{"synopsis":"Dari Author yang mengerjakan \\<The Last Adventurer> dan Studio yang mengerjakan \\<Nano Machine, Pick Me Up, Omniscient Reader’s Viewpoint>.\n\n\"Balas dendamku baru akan berakhir setelah aku memusnahkan seluruh Demon Spirit.\"\n\nSetelah secara brutal memenggal dan memajang kepala Demon Spirit yang membunuh kedua orang tuanya,&#x20;\n\nbocah bernama 'Ise' disebut monster oleh warga desa.\n\nKarena sudah tidak punya keinginan hidup lagi, 'Ise' bertemu dengan 'Mong Ryeon'.&#x20;\n\nSeorang dokkaebi sekaligus pemburu Demon Spirit.\n\nDalam kehidupan itu, Mong Ryeon menyadari adanya suatu 'keanehan' dalam diri Ise.\n\nMong Ryeon mengirim Ise ke \"Kelompok Algojo\", yaitu perguruan bela diri bernama 'The Great Martial Path'...","alternative_title":"멸귀수도전","author":"Salty Dog","artist":"Redice Studio, Yeon Woo-sol","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"kc_ch_chronicles-of-the-demon-slaying-cultivator_7","number":"7","chapter":"7","title":"Chapter 7","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_a61d6822-6001-45f1-99f5-501c81441583/chapter_kc_ch_chronicles-of-the-demon-slaying-cultivator_7/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_a61d6822-6001-45f1-99f5-501c81441583/chapter_kc_ch_chronicles-of-the-demon-slaying-cultivator_7/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_a61d6822-6001-45f1-99f5-501c81441583/chapter_kc_ch_chronicles-of-the-demon-slaying-cultivator_7/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_a61d6822-6001-45f1-99f5-501c81441583/chapter_kc_ch_chronicles-of-the-demon-slaying-cultivator_7/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_a61d6822-6001-45f1-99f5-501c81441583/chapter_kc_ch_chronicles-of-the-demon-slaying-cultivator_7/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_a61d6822-6001-45f1-99f5-501c81441583/chapter_kc_ch_chronicles-of-the-demon-slaying-cultivator_7/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_a61d6822-6001-45f1-99f5-501c81441583/chapter_kc_ch_chronicles-of-the-demon-slaying-cult